   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why it works: the QA tokens cannot see the input, only the <EMB> tokens.\nTo answer, all item information must flow through the embedding.\nWarm start: QA may see the input at first; that attention is annealed to zero.",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Why it works: the QA tokens cannot see the input, only the <EMB> tokens.\nTo answer, all item information must flow through the embedding.\nWarm start: QA may see the input at first; that attention is annealed to zero.",
